      "start_seconds": 0.73,
      "end_seconds": 4.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "hello, doctor. I think it's my turn"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.39,
      "end_seconds": 9.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "that's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.2,
      "end_seconds": 15.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got blurry vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.65,
      "end_seconds": 19.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.66,
      "end_seconds": 26.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "It's been going on for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.06,
      "end_seconds": 29.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "have you had any confusion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.75,
      "end_seconds": 33.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any confusion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.85,
      "end_seconds": 39.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any vomiting, abdominal pain or fruity smelling breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.91,
      "end_seconds": 43.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.81,
      "end_seconds": 50.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.93,
      "end_seconds": 52.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "no, nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.69,
      "end_seconds": 58.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.79,
      "end_seconds": 62.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.63,
      "end_seconds": 82.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.29,
      "end_seconds": 86.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.01,
      "end_seconds": 90.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.71,
      "end_seconds": 94.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "no, nothing at the moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.35,
      "end_seconds": 112.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.56,
      "end_seconds": 115.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.72,
      "end_seconds": 119.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.39,
      "end_seconds": 125.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "I had keyhole surgery on my gallbladder two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.39,
      "end_seconds": 127.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.6,
      "end_seconds": 133.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.65,
      "end_seconds": 136.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.61,
      "end_seconds": 146.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.9,
      "end_seconds": 165.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.31,
      "end_seconds": 181.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Right, keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.99,
      "end_seconds": 215.32,
      "duration_seconds": 13.33,
      "text": "okay: weight 64 kilos, pressure 158 over 90, height 154 centimetres, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, pulse 92, respiratory rate 14, BMI works out to 27.0, temp 36.5 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.32,
      "end_seconds": 217.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.69,
      "end_seconds": 220.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.67,
      "end_seconds": 226.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.21,
      "end_seconds": 229.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "yeah, no problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.33,
      "end_seconds": 232.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.76,
      "end_seconds": 253.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "Your fingerprick sugar here is high, and your feet have good pulses and normal feeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.28,
      "end_seconds": 256.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.73,
      "end_seconds": 263.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.02,
      "end_seconds": 286.64,
      "duration_seconds": 14.62,
      "text": "from what you've told me and what I found, this is probably symptoms that point to newly developed type 2 diabetes let's book an HbA1c to to look into suspected diabetes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.66,
      "end_seconds": 292.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "that's fine with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.68,
      "end_seconds": 319.12,
      "duration_seconds": 24.44,
      "text": "The treatment will be metformin, 500 milligrams, once a day with food, long term. It's for high blood sugar. Cut right down on sugary drinks and keep water with you. One warning sign to remember: you are vomiting or feel confused. In that case don't wait. Let's review you in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.36,
      "end_seconds": 324.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "I'll book it on my way out"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.31,
      "end_seconds": 327.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.71,
      "end_seconds": 332.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
